* Mon Oct 21 2024 Qinyun Tan <qinyuntan@linux.alibaba.com> [5.10.134-17.3_rc1%%DIST%%]
- anolis: RDMA/erdma: Randomize the first allocated QPN (红海)
- anolis: net/smc: dump CDC msg in rwwi Tx and Rx path (Wen Gu)
- anolis: net/smc: dump CDC msg in Tx and Rx normal path (Wen Gu)
- anolis: net/smc: dump raw data in Tx and Rx path (Wen Gu)
- anolis: net/smc: implementation of dump data function (Wen Gu)
- anolis: net/smc: add netlink interface for dump_ndev operations (Wen Gu)
- anolis: net/smc: workaround for smc_pnet use with erdma OOB (Guangguan Wang)
- anolis: net/smc: introduce two sysctls for SMC-R memory limitation (Tony Lu)
- anolis: net/smc: support ipv4 mapped ipv6 addr client for smc-r v2 (Guangguan Wang)
- anolis: net/smc: Fix memleak in percpu ref (Kai Shen)
- anolis: net/smc: always set sk_user_data for IPPROTO_SMC (D. Wythe)
- anolis: RDMA/erdma: Support kernel-space scatter sq/rq buffer (红海)
- net/smc: introduce statistics for ringbufs usage of net namespace (Wen Gu)
- net/smc: introduce statistics for allocated ringbufs of link group (Wen Gu)
- net/smc: add sysctl for smc_limit_hs (D. Wythe)
- anolis: net/smc: fix for divide error in smc_dim (Guangguan Wang)
- anolis: net/smc: change min conn per lgr to 1 (Guangguan Wang)
- anolis: do not repeate stat rmb tx peer full when autosplit (Guangguan Wang)
- anolis: net/smc: introduce autosplit for smc (Guangguan Wang)
- anolis: RDMA/erdma: Protect netdev reference in struct erdma_dev (红海)
- anolis: RDMA/erdma: Update erdma driver (红海)
- anolis: uprobe: avoid out-of-bounds memory access of fetching args. (Qiao Ma)
- bpf: Enforce W^X for bpf trampoline (Song Liu)
- crypto: ecc - Move ecc.h to include/crypto/internal (Daniele Alessandrelli)
- crypto: ecc - expose ecc curves (Meng Yu)
- anolis: configs: add ECDSA config (Xuchun Shang)
- x509: Add OID for NIST P384 and extend parser for it (Saulo Alessandre)
- ima: Support EC keys for signature verification (Stefan Berger)
- x509: Add support for parsing x509 certs with ECDSA keys (Stefan Berger)
- crypto: ecdsa - Register NIST P384 and extend test suite (Saulo Alessandre)
- crypto: ecc - Add math to support fast NIST P384 (Saulo Alessandre)
- crypto: ecc - Add NIST P384 curve parameters (Saulo Alessandre)
- crypto: ecdsa - Add support for ECDSA signature verification (Stefan Berger)
- oid_registry: Add OIDs for ECDSA with SHA224/256/384/512 (Stefan Berger)
- anolis: swiotlb: reserve in high mem with guest encrypted (Xuchun Shang)
- PCI/DPC: Await readiness of secondary bus after reset (Lukas Wunner)
- PCI: Unify delay handling for reset and resume (Lukas Wunner)
- PCI/PM: Observe reset delay irrespective of bridge_d3 (Lukas Wunner)
- drivers/perf: Fix ali_drw_pmu driver interrupt status clearing (Jing Zhang)

